    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it would be nice to listen to while taking a relaxed walk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849139,
    "dDurationMs": 3254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But actually, who takes a walk that leisurely? Nobody really does that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854395,
    "dDurationMs": 1751,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Boom-chick boom-chick"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856146,
    "dDurationMs": 2128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you have a lot of stress, you might"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858274,
    "dDurationMs": 1876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You might, that's true"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860150,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess I have quite a bit of stress these days"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862027,
    "dDurationMs": 1836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Seems like it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863863,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Loosen up your shoulders too..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 864989,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that's right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 867825,
    "dDurationMs": 4463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was my first song"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872288,
    "dDurationMs": 5589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes, like, sounds of nature?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877877,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These kinds of techniques of putting them in songs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881547,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think they're really good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885175,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887344,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have a favorite Japanese DJ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890973,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Someone who's no longer in this world now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894894,
    "dDurationMs": 6172,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Among the songs that person made"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901066,
    "dDurationMs": 5464,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a drum snare, you know, boom boom tap boom tap,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 906530,
    "dDurationMs": 8217,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's a song where the instrument that makes that tapping sound is expressed as a cricket sound"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914747,
    "dDurationMs": 6464,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a song by a DJ producer named Nujabes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921211,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's good too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922796,
    "dDurationMs": 5005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you go outside and listen to it during grass insect season, it's really nice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 927801,
    "dDurationMs": 5422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's like, is this sound coming from my earphones or from outside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933223,
    "dDurationMs": 3546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think the experience of them blending together harmoniously is nice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936769,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, that's right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939188,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I brought one Japanese song like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 941815,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's the second song that Teacher Tae-woong recommends?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 945027,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second song I picked is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 948989,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This... King TS!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951325,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "BTS's..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952785,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ㅋㅋㅋ I wasn't sure what you were saying, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 957498,
    "dDurationMs": 5755,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a song called \"Paradise\" by Got7 (Got+TS)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963253,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's nice, but..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964463,
    "dDurationMs": 4713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Aren't you kind of forcing a Korean song"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969176,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and intentionally picking BTS?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972846,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Please don't say I forced it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 977142,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like \"I have to do a Korean song\" and..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979728,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't say I forcibly brought BTS."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 983691,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Be careful ㅋㅋㅋ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984817,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You really like it and brought it, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986694,
    "dDurationMs": 959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987653,
    "dDurationMs": 10260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm... actually not a fan of idols like BTS or BLACKPINK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 997913,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To be really honest about it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000457,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but songs that sound good to me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004503,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like them regardless of whether they're just good songs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007006,
    "dDurationMs": 750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007756,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's why there are several BTS songs I like among them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012678,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is one of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015264,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the way, among BLACKPINK songs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017182,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like the song \"Lily\" the best."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019560,
    "dDurationMs": 5922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003cReally\u003e"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1025482,
    "dDurationMs": 1043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's \"Really?!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028068,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The pronunciation was strange so I said it again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1030195,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, BTS's Paradise,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033699,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it probably has a separate English name."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1036535,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's Paradise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1038370,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040164,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I brought that song,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043500,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and most of the lyrics are in Korean,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046587,
    "dDurationMs": 4671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I really like Korean songs like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1051258,
    "dDurationMs": 4713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These days Korean pop and hip-hop songs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1055971,
    "dDurationMs": 4713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "often have a little Korean and mostly English,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1060684,
    "dDurationMs": 5255,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but lyrics that are mostly in Korean have so much charm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065939,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like it too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1067357,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1068525,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But among them, this song \"Paradise\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1072196,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has such a good message in the lyrics too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1074865,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is... the entire lyrics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079161,
    "dDurationMs": 7507,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are about not carrying too much burden about a certain dream,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086668,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you don't need to have such a grand dream,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1090089,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it reassures you like that and encourages you and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092341,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's like a comforting letter message."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096303,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the beat is good too, actually."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1098889,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, is this an upbeat song too?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101016,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not that upbeat like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102976,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that so? I should listen to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1105854,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106855,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me listen to it first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110567,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How have I never heard this before?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1112277,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm hearing it for the first time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114363,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are several other good songs on this album too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1117908,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Songs that I like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1123288,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The part I like comes later."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1128919,
    "dDurationMs": 6590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has a completely boy group kind of feel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1135509,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The lyrics are really comforting content."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1138804,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's fine~"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1139805,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ding ding ding ding ding~"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1141473,
    "dDurationMs": 6423,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you probably search for this song on YouTube,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147896,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'll see a ton of comments saying the lyrics are good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1152067,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh yeah, yeah, yeah, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1154153,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, with K-pop groups like BTS,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1160993,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are a lot of people who start learning Korean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1163829,
    "dDurationMs": 4546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they want to understand the lyrics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168375,
    "dDurationMs": 709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1169084,
    "dDurationMs": 6632,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if possible, I think it's good when people like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175716,
    "dDurationMs": 6173,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the message of the lyrics or, how do I put it, the emotional tone and things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181889,
    "dDurationMs": 4462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, and then you listen to the song more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186351,
    "dDurationMs": 4547,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I hope that people learning Korean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1190898,
    "dDurationMs": 4045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can start with a good emotional foundation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194943,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is there a case of the opposite?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197487,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I don't think there really is..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201116,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1202117,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "curses or insults..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1203702,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh yeah, yeah, I understand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1206371,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, if there are a lot of those and people start with that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1209458,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it might not be so good, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1213295,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's not just songs—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1216840,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's a huge amount of Korean content out there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1218884,
    "dDurationMs": 4921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But some of it mocks the weak,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223805,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or gets angry at people who think differently,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1227309,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or that kind of content,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1230062,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and people could encounter Korea and Korean through that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234024,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think it would be nice if people could encounter Korea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1240864,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as brightly, positively, and hopefully as possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244326,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, and when learning Korean,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246495,
    "dDurationMs": 4212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's good to hear a lot of beautiful Korean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1250707,
    "dDurationMs": 4797,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "K-pop is spreading worldwide as this Korean Wave phenomenon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1255504,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1258382,
    "dDurationMs": 2752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But at first, I thought"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1261134,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people just liked it because the performance was good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1264721,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when I see lyrics like these,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1266348,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it seems like there are people who get real comfort from them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1270269,
    "dDurationMs": 4462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I think these hopeful, somewhat comforting lyrics are really nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1274731,
    "dDurationMs": 1335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1276066,
    "dDurationMs": 5255,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the decisive reason I chose this song is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1281321,
    "dDurationMs": 4088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "last weekend, or was it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1285409,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the weekend before last,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1287119,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did a live stream on the Comprehensible Input Korean channel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1291999,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I asked the live viewers and subscribers something like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1295836,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I asked, \"Why are you studying Korean?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1299840,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was really, really curious,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1302092,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I asked, \"Is this fun?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1307014,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the reasons why they study turned out to be really diverse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1311310,
    "dDurationMs": 5130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But among them, there were things like, \"Well, it's cool if you can speak a foreign language,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1316440,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just these kinds of simple reasons too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1320694,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's not like you need some grand dream"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1322904,
    "dDurationMs": 3129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or a grand reason."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1326033,
    "dDurationMs": 750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1326783,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I'm just having fun doing it, that's enough,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329703,
    "dDurationMs": 4338,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if I just feel good doing this, that's enough,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1334041,
    "dDurationMs": 4879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I think that connects a bit with these lyrics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1338920,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I chose this song."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1340881,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When studying Korean, you don't have to achieve something grand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1344968,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1345802,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like I'm talking too much..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1347763,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1349431,
    "dDurationMs": 792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's nice, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1350223,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I did that a lot when I was young too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1353727,
    "dDurationMs": 5005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you learn a foreign language by singing along like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1358732,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your pronunciation improves tremendously"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362486,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it helps with pronunciation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1364363,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, it really helps a lot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1366490,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1367657,
    "dDurationMs": 4797,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I was young, I used to follow along with Kanye West's rap exactly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372454,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1373705,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Very young, like 20 years ago"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1375665,
    "dDurationMs": 1419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It must have been really fast, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1377084,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, like 15 years ago, 15 years ago"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1379378,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1379878,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, and my English pronunciation improved a lot back then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1383673,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um~ the lyrics, the lyrics..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1386301,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How were those lyrics? Was it pretty English?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1389596,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um, I don't think it was quite like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1396228,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wish I had learned songs with such good lyrics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1399606,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exactly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400607,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was no one to teach me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402567,
    "dDurationMs": 1335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403902,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, even now..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1405904,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They say it helps a lot with pronunciation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1408323,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Singing along to the lyrics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1409574,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you have any other favorite songs? Among BTS songs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1413495,
    "dDurationMs": 5005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are many, but on that same album"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1418500,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a song that's hard to remember the name of, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1420836,
    "dDurationMs": 709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1421545,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because that name isn't a word"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1424840,
    "dDurationMs": 4546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's numbers, numbers 1, 4, what what what what what like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1429386,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1430679,
    "dDurationMs": 6673,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the lyrics of that song are really sophisticated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1437352,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pluto?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1439312,
    "dDurationMs": 1836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pluto in space?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1441148,
    "dDurationMs": 7215,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back in the day, Pluto was an official planet in the solar system, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1448363,
    "dDurationMs": 584,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1448947,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then at some point Pluto was removed from the solar system"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452993,
    "dDurationMs": 7382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they changed that into a story about human relationships"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1460375,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that was so..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1463336,
    "dDurationMs": 1252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Philosophical, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1464588,
    "dDurationMs": 4629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was philosophical and poetic and the way it was expressed was so beautiful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1469217,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The song is called 134340"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1472762,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How do you even remember that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1473722,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "134340"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1475724,
    "dDurationMs": 5088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For those who want to listen to this additionally, please give it a listen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1480812,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "BTS's Paradise"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483440,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, that was my second song"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1485400,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And my second song is!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1487027,
    "dDurationMs": 4337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, I thought I should bring a Korean song too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1491364,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I brought one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1493992,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not, I didn't force it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1498288,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*I too* haha"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1500248,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did that too~"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1502000,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1503752,
    "dDurationMs": 1501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1505253,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh there are quite a few, but there are so many good songs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1508715,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh but it's a walking playlist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1512385,
    "dDurationMs": 4088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If a song called 'Walking' is missing, wouldn't it feel a bit sad?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1516473,
    "dDurationMs": 4755,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Baek Yerin, a singer named Baek Yerin, the song 'Walking'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1521228,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I chose it as the second song."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1523063,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just brought it as is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1526566,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, just like that!ㅋㅋㅋ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528318,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah but I really like this song, I sing it often at the noraebang too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1532405,
    "dDurationMs": 793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1533198,
    "dDurationMs": 1376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a song I like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1534574,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's do one song, then this time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1536910,
    "dDurationMs": 4212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1541122,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1543875,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I thought about it a bit—I like sensual hip-hop and things like that too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1547712,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like it would be good for taking a walk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1549881,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when taking a walk, it's really nice to listen like this, matching the lyrics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1554177,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I brought it along."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1557305,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should we listen to it right away, bit by bit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562894,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like your footsteps become lighter?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1565897,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like you've become a ballerina?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1567524,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, that's right—right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1574406,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Doesn't it sound a bit like a children's song? The melody and all?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1578368,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1579661,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I sing it at the noraebang, it really becomes a children's song, just like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1583790,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A children's nursery rhyme."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1585625,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when you listen to Baek Yerin singing it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1588503,
    "dDurationMs": 6215,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's really a song that's emotionally tender and moist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1594718,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This song originally has a different original version."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1598013,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's \"A Walk\" by a singer named So-hee."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1601308,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because the song is so good, there are several remade versions out there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1604728,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's Baek Yerin's version too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1605895,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there are versions by other singers as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1608898,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's good..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1610817,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you listen to the song, the lyrics are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1614070,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually about taking a real walk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1616239,
    "dDurationMs": 5130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you're taking a walk, like \"I wish I had done this with this person,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1621369,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you think of someone, someone while"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1624164,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "taking a walk—that kind of lyrics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1626124,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that someone is up to your imagination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1630086,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It could be someone you like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1631963,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It could be someone who has passed away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1634049,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really diverse..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1635175,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1637469,
    "dDurationMs": 3461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah but I really like lyrics like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1640930,
    "dDurationMs": 4213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, lyrics you can imagine like this? Lyrics you can interpret?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1645143,
    "dDurationMs": 5714,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, and it could be a story a man is telling,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1650857,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or it could be a story a woman is telling—those kinds of lyrics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1652859,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really love lyrics like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1656154,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Leaving it to imagination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1658657,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Depending on who you imagine it to be,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1661117,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the song can become really sad,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1663995,
    "dDurationMs": 5381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or it can become a really exciting song—that kind of song."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1669376,
    "dDurationMs": 3878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, it really could become sad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1673254,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With someone you can never see again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1675131,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wishing you had taken a walk together—that could be the song."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1679010,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, that's so sad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1680136,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It could be an ex-lover."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1682597,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's not quite as sad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1686101,
    "dDurationMs": 4546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're being cold-hearted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1690647,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is nice—should we move on to the third one now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1692732,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, sounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1694359,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what's Tae-woong's recommendation for the third song?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1696778,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The third recommendation is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1698780,
    "dDurationMs": 1376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Spinners,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1700156,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Spinners' \"I'll Be Around\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1702283,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the song."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1705245,
    "dDurationMs": 5088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like it's going to be really boom-chick boom-chick, doesn't it? Already?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1710333,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1711876,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's not it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1714546,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a song that can go boom-chick boom-chick or it might not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1718633,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this one, you see,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1721094,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, this is really a song I really love."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1723138,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A song I've listened to a lot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1725640,
    "dDurationMs": 4797,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and whenever it plays, it's just \"great!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1730437,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No matter who listens to it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1731980,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No matter who listens to it, they'll feel this way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1734816,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really? It seems like a famous song?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1737277,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, is it? Is it famous?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1738528,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Looking at the YouTube view count, it seems to have been played a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1741698,
    "dDurationMs": 1084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a masterpiece."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1742782,
    "dDurationMs": 1377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A masterpiece, a banger?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1744159,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1745785,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You just listen and go \"Wow, that's great.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1748079,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should we just play it without asking or questioning? Right away?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1749914,
    "dDurationMs": 918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1752375,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Great!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1753209,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's good, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1754961,
    "dDurationMs": 1084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1756045,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's like this cool breeze,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1760008,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "brushing past my head—don't you feel that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1763094,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1764095,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I picture Busan, you know? Something like the seaside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1767140,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1770226,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I go for seaside walks often,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1774063,
    "dDurationMs": 3379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so really, this song doesn't need any special reason, you'd agree, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1777442,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, it's so good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1780403,
    "dDurationMs": 8175,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And on top of that, the title \"I'll Be Around\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1788578,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "means like \"I'll be around you,\" you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1792123,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1793416,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What the lyrics are saying is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1795877,
    "dDurationMs": 5797,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this case, I think it's something being said to a person,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1801674,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're going to make your own choices,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1805428,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what you want is what you want,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1809057,
    "dDurationMs": 4463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I'm going to be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1813520,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "near you for you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1816064,
    "dDurationMs": 4588,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so whenever you want to call me, just call me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1820652,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whenever you need me, let me know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1823780,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and since I'll be nearby,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1827158,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll show up anytime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1829244,
    "dDurationMs": 2752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How reassuring is that!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1831996,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for those of you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1836000,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "studying Korean, our subscribers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1839963,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with just a few taps,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1842257,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our YouTube content is right there, isn't it?!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1846052,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tae-woong and Didi are \"I'll Be Around,\" so to speak..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1849055,
    "dDurationMs": 5923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, we're always here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1854978,
    "dDurationMs": 792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1855770,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you're studying a foreign language,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1858356,
    "dDurationMs": 4463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can't do it 365 days a year, 24 hours a day, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1862819,
    "dDurationMs": 6673,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As you're doing it, sometimes you want to watch an interesting Netflix show in between,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1869492,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or sometimes you play a fun game,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1871578,
    "dDurationMs": 6256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so your interest can drift away sometimes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1877834,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that's not a bad thing, in my opinion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1881504,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course that can happen when you're living life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1883965,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anytime works!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1886593,
    "dDurationMs": 5422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's always a place to come back to whenever you think of it again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1892015,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1894684,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's nice to become that kind of YouTuber."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1898438,
    "dDurationMs": 459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1898897,
    "dDurationMs": 1876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'I'm always here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1900773,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "go watch Netflix and come back!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1902984,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm uploading new content here every week!'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1906446,
    "dDurationMs": 459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1906905,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, that's great!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1909365,
    "dDurationMs": 793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1910158,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We will be around, everyone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1912535,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1914203,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the song is really nice too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1918374,
    "dDurationMs": 3379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's good when you play it!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1921753,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's good when you play it!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1922879,
    "dDurationMs": 5881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, sometimes when you're driving or you need to pick a song to play yourself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1928760,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are times when you're genuinely unsure what to choose,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1931429,
    "dDurationMs": 1376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if you just play this one,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1932805,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everyone will like it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1934682,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, like \"Oh? That's a good song, what is it?\" that kind of thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1939896,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1941773,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you for the three song recommendations,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1944859,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and lastly, I'll recommend my third song."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1949781,
    "dDurationMs": 4588,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a song called 'Clean and Dirty',"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1954369,
    "dDurationMs": 5255,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Harvard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1959624,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Harvard University?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1961042,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like it's that Harvard from Harvard University."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1965171,
    "dDurationMs": 4338,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I brought this because I originally wanted to bring a variety,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1969509,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one Korean song, one Japanese song,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1971970,
    "dDurationMs": 1584,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I wanted to bring one pop song,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1973554,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I brought it thinking it was a pop song,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1977433,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it turned out to be a Japanese song too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1978601,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because the lyrics are in English,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1981437,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've been thinking of it as a pop song until now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1985066,
    "dDurationMs": 1335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1986401,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Korean people have probably heard this song at least once in an advertisement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1988778,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or somewhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1992448,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This song,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1994784,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "honestly, I don't really know the lyrics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1997870,
    "dDurationMs": 5965,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that melody is really like a gentle breeze, a gentle breeze."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2003835,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As soon as the song starts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2005003,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the breeze just blows in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2007672,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the kind of song it is, so let me play it for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2011467,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A breeze"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2013219,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "blows in. 💨"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2015638,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It sounds like an ending credit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2018766,
    "dDurationMs": 1669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Listen to it on your way home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2020435,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After your walk is done, at the very end..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2022437,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, it's the way back home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2023855,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, you're heading back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2025815,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right now it feels like names are scrolling down next to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2029944,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has that ending credit feeling?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2033239,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This sound is like a whistling sound,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2036451,
    "dDurationMs": 1751,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and also like a wind sound, refreshing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2038202,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's that kind of refreshing song."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2039829,
    "dDurationMs": 5047,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The lyrics, let me see,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2044876,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're in English, so I thought it was a pop song."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2047754,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you think? Have you heard it before, Teacher Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2049672,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm hearing it for the first time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2050840,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, is that so?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2051674,
    "dDurationMs": 3796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seemed like it was used in an advertisement somewhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2055470,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you know when the song came out?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2058014,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's quite old."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2059807,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even just the version uploaded on YouTube here is over ten years old."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2065813,
    "dDurationMs": 5089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really like retro songs like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2070902,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This one is really good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2072570,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was thinking of a walking playlist, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2075656,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this was the first song that came to mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2079410,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the way home after the walk ends,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2082413,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's the kind of song that's good for wrapping things up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2085666,
    "dDurationMs": 7716,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like putting the end credits behind your back as you walk,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2093382,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've never thought of it as end credits before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2096803,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now that you mention it, there is that feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2097637,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now that I listen to it... yes, wrapping up so nicely like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2100473,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if we listen to all six songs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2102225,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think we could wrap up the walk really well, don't you think?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2105728,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2107188,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So with today's quiz, you should be able to get the answer now from what we mentioned earlier, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2110942,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Please leave your quiz answer in the comments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2114570,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then we'll think about the next topic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2117240,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What would be a good next topic?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2119700,
    "dDurationMs": 5256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next topic is that October is the season of autumn,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2124956,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and autumn is the season of clear skies and high horses,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2127500,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and also the season of reading, isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2129168,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2130378,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So... what books are interesting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2134674,
    "dDurationMs": 5213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what standards and tastes do we have when we read books and enjoy them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2139887,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and also our favorite books,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2142807,
    "dDurationMs": 792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "books we've enjoyed reading—"
